---
import NoteLayout from '../../layouts/NoteLayout.astro';

const pdfHref = '/notes/QFT_NN.pdf';
---

<NoteLayout
  title="Correspondence between Quantum Field Theory and Neural Networks"
  description="Katya Ivshina's final paper from Princeton's PHY509 (Introduction to Quantum Field Theory), reviewing the correspondence between Quantum Field Theory and Neural Networks."
  date="Jan ’22"
>
  <p>
    I took <em>PHY509: Introduction to Quantum Field Theory</em> graduate class at
    Princeton University, and <a href={pdfHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>
    is my final paper reviewing the correspondence between Quantum Field Theory and
    Neural Networks.
  </p>

  <a class="paper-card" href={pdfHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    <span class="paper-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="22" height="26" viewBox="0 0 22 26" fill="none">
        <path d="M3 1h11l6 6v17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M14 1v6h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="paper-meta">
      <span class="paper-title">Correspondence between QFT and Neural Networks</span>
      <span class="paper-sub">Final paper · PDF</span>
    </span>
    <span class="paper-cta" aria-hidden="true">Read →</span>
  </a>

  <figure class="paper-embed">
    <object data={`${pdfHref}#view=FitH`} type="application/pdf" aria-label="QFT and Neural Networks paper (PDF preview)">
      <p>
        Your browser can't display the embedded PDF.
        <a href={pdfHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download the paper</a> instead.
      </p>
    </object>
  </figure>
</NoteLayout>

<style>
  .paper-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    background: #FAF8F3;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 25, 22, 0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .paper-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(181, 48, 42, 0.4);
    background: var(--cream-2);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .paper-icon { color: #B5302A; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 0; }

  .paper-meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
  .paper-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
  }
  .paper-sub {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .paper-cta {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #B5302A;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .paper-embed {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }
  .paper-embed object {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: min(80vh, 900px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 25, 22, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--cream-2);
  }
  .paper-embed p { padding: 1.25rem; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .paper-embed { display: none; }
  }
</style>
